 connected\nCellular Signal: excellent\nCellular Network Type: 5G\nMobile Data Enabled: No\nData Roaming Enabled: No\nWi-Fi Radio: OFF\nWi-Fi Connected: No","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":13,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:59:12.650161","tool_call_id":"call_SyCYi5EMjNjrKVnAPEqyOoSj","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":13,"usage":null},{"content":"Here’s what I found:\n- My phone shows excellent signal strength and is connected to 5G, but mobile data is currently disabled.\n- Airplane mode is off, and my SIM card is active.\n- Wi-Fi is also turned off.\n\nWhat should I do next? Should I enable mobile data?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":14,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:59:14.185468","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":14,"usage":{"completion_tokens":64,"prompt_tokens":2792}},{"content":"Yes, please enable mobile data on your phone. MMS messages require an active mobile data connection to send and receive, even if you have a strong signal and are connected to 5G.\n\nOnce you have enabled mobile data, try sending an MMS message again. Let me know if the issue is resolved or if you still experience problems.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:59:15.346600","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":69,"prompt_tokens":6934}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:59:16.363173","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_0LrqCBnBbIz6vNDkRn1YGm6U","name":"toggle_data","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":16,"usage":{"completion_tokens":11,"prompt_tokens":2929}},{"content":"Mobile Data is now ON.\nStatus Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:59:16.363620","tool_call_id":"call_0LrqCBnBbIz6vNDkRn1YGm6U","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":17,"usage":null},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:59:17.457175","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_j4lotiy58e91Vmjbrt4HBVwN","name":"can_send_mms","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":18,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":2974}},{"content":"Your messaging app cannot send MMS messages.","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:59:17.457360","tool_call_id":"call_j4lotiy58e91Vmjbrt4HBVwN","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":19,"usage":null},{"content":"I’ve enabled mobile data, but I’m still unable to send MMS messages from my messaging app. What should I try next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T14:59:18.657555","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":20,"usage":{"completion_tokens":28,"prompt_tokens":3002}},{"content":"Thank you for enabling mobile data. The next step is to check your phone’s APN (Access Point Name) settings, as incorrect APN settings are a common cause of MMS issues.\n\nPlease check your APN settings and let me know if you see any errors or if the MMSC URL is missing. If you’re unsur